    "raw_text": "# Descriptive concept source excerpt\n\n[Source paragraph 1; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n$\\nabla$  ——哈密顿算子，  $\\nabla = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\pmb {i} + \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\pmb {j} + \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}\\pmb{k}_{\\circ}$\n\n[Source paragraph 2; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n对于定常流动，  $\\frac{\\partial\\rho}{\\partial t} = 0$  ，连续方程为：\n\n[Source paragraph 3; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n$$\n\\nabla \\cdot (\\rho \\mathbf {v}) = 0 \\tag {3.3}\n$$\n\n[Source paragraph 4; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n对于不可压缩流体，各处密度均相等，且不随时间变化，即  $\\rho =$  常数，则连续方程为：\n\n[Source paragraph 5; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n$$\n\\nabla \\cdot v = \\frac {\\partial u}{\\partial x} + \\frac {\\partial v}{\\partial y} + \\frac {\\partial w}{\\partial z} = 0 \\tag {3.4}\n$$\n\n[Source paragraph 6; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n对于一维不可压缩管流，在同一时刻其各截面体积流量均相等，即：\n\n",
    "canonical_text": "# Descriptive concept source excerpt\n\n[Source paragraph 1; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n$\\nabla$  ——哈密顿算子，  $\\nabla = \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\pmb {i} + \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\pmb {j} + \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z}\\pmb{k}_{\\circ}$\n\n[Source paragraph 2; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n对于定常流动，  $\\frac{\\partial\\rho}{\\partial t} = 0$  ，连续方程为：\n\n[Source paragraph 3; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n$$\n\\nabla \\cdot (\\rho \\mathbf {v}) = 0 \\tag {3.3}\n$$\n\n[Source paragraph 4; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n对于不可压缩流体，各处密度均相等，且不随时间变化，即  $\\rho =$  常数，则连续方程为：\n\n[Source paragraph 5; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n$$\n\\nabla \\cdot v = \\frac {\\partial u}{\\partial x} + \\frac {\\partial v}{\\partial y} + \\frac {\\partial w}{\\partial z} = 0 \\tag {3.4}\n$$\n\n[Source paragraph 6; 3.2.2 连续方程; intervening text may be omitted]\n\n对于一维不可压缩管流，在同一时刻其各截面体积流量均相等，即：\n\n"
